{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32130","headline":"拂舞词 · 温庭筠","name":"拂舞词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄河怒浪连天来，大响谹谹如殷雷。\n龙伯驱风不敢上，百川喷雪高崔嵬。\n二十三弦何太哀，请公勿渡立徘徊。\n下有狂蛟锯爲尾，裂帆截櫂磨霜齿。\n神椎凿石塞神潭，白马䟃𧽼赤尘起\n公乎跃马扬玉鞭，灭没高蹄日千里。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32130.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32130","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}